Under the Code on Wages 2019, an employee is disqualified from receiving a bonus if they are dismissed from their service due to any of the following specific acts of misconduct:

* Fraud;
* Riotous or violent behavior while on the premises of the establishment;
* Theft, misappropriation, or sabotage of any property belonging to the establishment; or
* A conviction for sexual harassment.

